<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jhon Perlaza, an Ecuadorian footballer, received an eight-year ban after throwing a stone at an assistant referee, illustrating violence spilling into sport. Ecuadorian fishermen have filed lawsuits against the United States, alleging a drone strike sank their boat near the Galápagos and linking the attack to broader security concerns. The bodies of Ecuadorian construction workers killed in a New York building collapse are being returned to Quito, prompting demands for justice. Former vice president Jorge Glas reported being beaten in prison, describing the incident as self-harm. The UCDP counted two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNZ3g4ODh6X3JMRUl6OE9MNzNFclBLM09acm5ZbmJsdDRlMmRMS0RzVDJBRFhxT3ZhR09TcEJ5WmVKTWdqM3F1bko4UnloVHpIR09Ja2NyX1h3TWM2emZtSDlUWEE1UnNaR01ZT0FaZ05hcHpiQ0hpUk5VWWtKVVlzYjNmY0tVamJld3QzUjNHQTA0ZDg5MXd3VFJKN0szNUpKaU9JRlVZY1NPcnRUdXZUeE1GbVN3THZOV0cyMVg0VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNcW5rUERZbGVnSVIzRE5mN2hsLUd4THFITGNBdXZ3SmJwTE8zTXRIOE9zZ3NSdDl2RWVMem9qMFByYTZKZ05JYWRIQjhfOXJFb0xFYUJqdXZfblZUcnpOd051X1MxUUdRS0tDeXIwckQ2OHk3QUlMcUcxaWlvMFBfaE43U20?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOenlhSlRZT0JoZFhsSWZ6aHV5QThwdmZIWUVMXzdHdVc2U2ZpNS1ZdEJ0VW0tUG5sa0poY2czV200TU82c0Y0S1J4YnNRLU05R3ZxNGVjX1hGMGpkU2Y2MllOZWJSMXR0N2hCRjJxcDlENWF4Z040dndyRnBCYnJ4Q0JScEVuRlVwZHhzb1JzVGNKTG02Q0F1dWpSbnZ3Ty1BTkx3eA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News &amp;amp; Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt